58 {\cf20 /* Define ASSIMP_BUILD_NO_XX_IMPORTER to disable a specific}\par
59 {\cf20  * file format loader. The loader is be excluded from the}\par
60 {\cf20  * build in this case. 'XX' stands for the most common file}\par
61 {\cf20  * extension of the file format. E.g.:}\par
62 {\cf20  * ASSIMP_BUILD_NO_X_IMPORTER disables the X loader.}\par
63 {\cf20  *}\par
64 {\cf20  * If you're unsure about that, take a look at the implementation of the}\par
65 {\cf20  * import plugin you wish to disable. You'll find the right define in the}\par
66 {\cf20  * first lines of the corresponding unit.}\par
67 {\cf20  *}\par
68 {\cf20  * Other (mixed) configuration switches are listed here:}\par
69 {\cf20  *    ASSIMP_BUILD_NO_COMPRESSED_X}\par
70 {\cf20  *      - Disable support for compressed X files (zip)}\par
